The '''2022 Norwich City Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Norwich City Council]] in England.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.norwich.gov.uk/ElectionResults |title=Norwich City Council election results - 5 May 2022 |access-date=7 May 2022 |work=Norwich City Council}}</ref> This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]]. 13 of 39 seats (one-third) were up for election.

